    "Q5_ICC_vs_nclx": {
      "answer": "Asymmetric. The base image item carries an ICC \"prof\" colr box (536-byte Apple Display P3 profile; heif-info: color profile prof; plus an additional nclx box with unspecified primaries/transfer, BT.601 matrix, full range). The ISO gain-map item is signalled only by nclx: primaries 12 (SMPTE EG 432-1 = Display P3), transfer 16 (SMPTE ST 2084 PQ), matrix 6, full range in the -b path; transfer 13 (sRGB/sYCC) in the -H path. ImageIO reports the aux colour space as \"ICCBased Display P3 + SMPTE ST 2084 PQ\" (-b) / \"ICCBased Display P3\" (-H).",
      "measured": {
        "baseItemColour": "colr prof (ICC Display P3) + nclx primaries=2 transfer=2 matrix=6 fullRange=1",
